      "id": "四、1（1）",
      "kind": "application",
      "question_latex": "（如下图）乐乐和欢欢每天早晨坚持跑步。乐乐每分钟跑220米，欢欢每分钟跑260米。（1）两人同时从家出发，相向而行，3分钟后在小区中心花园相遇，两家相距多少米？",
      "options": [],
      "tables": [],
      "diagrams": [
        {
          "tikz": "\\begin{tikzpicture}\\draw(-2,0)--(0,0)--(3.2,0);\\draw(0,0)--(3.7,-1.6);\\foreach \\x/\\y/\\t/\\pos in {-2/0/乐乐家/above,0/0/中心花园/above,3.2/0/欢欢家/above,3.7/-1.6/学校/below}{\\fill(\\x,\\y)circle(1.5pt);\\node[\\pos]at(\\x,\\y){\\t};}\\end{tikzpicture}",
          "role": "question",
          "notes": "",
          "name": "p023_s15_g1"
        }
      ],
      "answer_latex": "方法一：速度和×时间\\par \\[\\begin{aligned} &(220+260)\\times3\\\\={}&480\\times3\\\\={}&1440\\text{(米)}\\end{aligned}\\]答：两家相距1440米。\\par 方法二：分别算两段路程\\par \\[\\begin{aligned} &220\\times3+260\\times3\\\\={}&660+780\\\\={}&1440\\text{(米)}\\end{aligned}\\]答：两家相距1440米。\\par ",
      "verification": {
